  "location": "Section 2 and Tables 1-3 (p. 54), Sections 2-3.3 (pp. 55-60), Figs. 4-6 and 8 (pp. 56-57), Figs. 20-21 (p. 60), Section 3.4 and Fig. 22 (pp. 60-61)"
